ilure, detectFork, validateReachable, report, loadAssignments) throw NotImplementedError, services (initInstance, resolveThread, pickThread, capture, seedFork) return an LHC not_implemented OpResult, createModelCall returns a fail-closed 'other' failure, and replayCorpus returns matches:false — no stub reports success. initLhc is provided as the createSdk rename (A-4). Test fixtures: corpus loader (5 named lifecycles) with a real validateCorpus shape/coherence checker + makeTruncatedCorpus, synthetic PI/intake builders, deterministic ModelCall fakes, and a real temp-SQLite-thread factory. 6 foundation test files / 19 tests cover corpus validity (+ invalid builder rejected), synthetic coherence, ModelCall fakes, temp-thread create+reopen, hook-rail registration + fail-closed/plain-data handlers + init/dispose seam, and verification-config presence.\"\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/06-startup-validation-and-assignment-config/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-continue\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Latest verifier outcome is revise with five blocking findings; the smallest safe next action is to continue the implementor work and address those findings directly.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"continuationRef\\\":\\\"storyImplementor\\\",\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Revise Story 6 implementation to close verifier findings SV-001 through SV-005 from /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/06-startup-validation-and-assignment-config/004-verify.json. Fix shipped defaults so all seven assignments are functional non-placeholder provider/model/prompt values and default loading goes through validation. Reject extra assignment keys loudly. Add a headless user-visible reporting path for unreachable lanes while still persisting SessionState.health. Strengthen TC-5.3 to prove affected-lane derivations fail classified and queryable through health after validation failure. Resolve the full-gate regression where test/lifecycle/thread-resolution.test.ts expected notes length 1 but got 2. Run the focused Story 6 tests and the configured story gate pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify before returning. Do not commit.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"After revision returns, rerun verifier against the new implementor artifact; acceptance still requires pass outcome, no open findings, and story gate proof.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/quick-fix/streams/004-quick-fix.stdout.log:9:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_3\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/zsh -lc 'git status --short'\",\"aggregated_output\":\" M AGENTS.md\\nRM packages/lhc/docs/01-onboard/01-core-concepts.md -> docs/onboard/01-core-concepts.md\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/01-onboard/02-domain-design.md -> docs/onboard/02-domain-design.md\\nRM packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/00-prd.md -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/00-prd.md\\nRM packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-tech-arch.md -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-tech-arch.md\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/01-epic.md -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/01-epic.md\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/02-tech-design.md -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/02-tech-design.md\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/03-test-plan.md -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/03-test-plan.md\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/00-foundation/001-story-validate.json\\nR  packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/00-foundation/002-story-orchestrate-run.json -> docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/01-thread-record-and-intake/artifacts/00-foundation/002-story-orchestrate-run.json\\nR  pa